/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 243 0 R
/E (The Security Operations Center \(SOC\) is the nerve centre of an organisation's cyber resilience. Yet as threats accelerate and attack surfaces expand, traditional SOC models are breaking down under the weight of alert fatigue, tool sprawl, and talent shortages. Analysts spend more time filtering noise than hunting real threats, and the gap between detection and response continues to narrow.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
269 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 243 0 R
/E (This playbook provides a practical framework for BFSI and FinTech leaders to transform their SOC from a reactive monitoring function into a proactive resilience engine. It covers the shift from traditional monitoring to modern approaches, the critical technologies and frameworks, the build-versus-buy decision, and the metrics that matter for continuous improvement.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
