1765 0 obj
<<
/Title (Modern enterprise environments generate logs at machine speed. A typical SOC receives thousands of alerts daily, with only a fraction ever reviewed. A large organisation's SOC might receive nearly 12,000 security alerts per day, of which only about 400 are actually reviewed, and perhaps 15 turn out to be real threats. The rest is noise: false positives, duplicate alerts, routine activity flagged as suspicious.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1724 0 R
>>
